feature=features', null, 'labels', 'some terms might need a plural (the terms for unit, lot and locus for instance). Enter each plural by entering the singular term, followed by = and the plural term. e.G. locus=loci. One plural per line.', null, 1, '7cebd12f-a2cd-c24b-acb2-d15543446d43', '2020-01-19 13:34:28.000000', '2026-04-07 19:46:28.000000 +00:00', '', false, null, 'yes', 40079121, '2026-04-07 15:46:28.000000', 63911187988850);
